 "くたくた": "اِسْتَهْلَكَ, اِسْتَنْفَدَ (To use up; to deplete, drain or expend wholly, or use until the supply comes to )  [exhausted]\nمثال: もう朝から晩まで働いてクタクタだよ。\n→ I'm beat. I've been working from dawn to dusk. / [battered (esp. of clothing) ; worn out]\nمثال: 彼はくたくたの背広を着ていた。\n→ He was wearing a threadbare suit. / [(boiling) to a pulp ; to a mash]\nمثال: くたくたに煮る。\n→ Reduce to pulp by boiling.",
 "くたばりぞこない": "لَا قِيمَةَ لَهُ, حَقِير (Having no worth or use; without value.)  [worthless (of a person)]",
