 "くだく": "اِنْكَسَرَ (intransitive: to separate into (to end up in) two or more pi) / كَسَرَ (transitive: to separate into (to cause to end up in) two or ) / اِسْتِرَاحَة (rest or pause, usually from work)  [to break (into pieces)]\nمثال: ピックは硬い地表を砕くために用いられる長い取っ手の道具だ。\n→ A pick is a long handled tool used for breaking up hard ground surfaces. / هَرَسَ (To reduce to fine particles by pounding or grinding.)  [to crush]\nمثال: 彼の希望は無残に砕かれた。\n→ His hopes were shattered. / [to simplify ; to make easy to understand]",
