 "くだける": "اِنْكَسَرَ (intransitive: to separate into (to end up in) two or more pi) / كَسَرَ (transitive: to separate into (to cause to end up in) two or ) / اِسْتِرَاحَة (rest or pause, usually from work)  [to break (into pieces)]\nمثال: 花瓶は粉々に砕けた。\n→ The vase burst into fragments. / اِنْهَار (To break apart and fall down suddenly; to cave in.) / اِنْهِيَار (The act of collapsing.)  [to collapse] / [to become less formal ; to throw off reserve] / [to become easy to understand (e.g. a story)]",
 "ください": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (give me)]\nirregular imperative of くださる\nمثال: 熱いココアを下さい。\n→ I'd like to have some hot chocolate. / أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (do for me)]\nafter te-form of a verb or a noun prefixed with o- or go-\nمثال: あなたの切手帳を見せてください。\n→ Please show me your stamp album.",
