 "くだし": "إخْلَاء, تَخْلِيَة (The act of evacuating; leaving a place in an orderly fashion, especially for saf) / إخْلَاء (Withdrawal of troops or civils from a town, country, fortress, etc.) / تَفْرِيغ, تَخْلِيَة (The act of emptying, clearing of the contents, or discharging, including creatin)  [evacuation]",
 "くだしあ": "أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (give me)] / أَرْضَى, أَعْجَبَ (To make happy or satisfy; to give pleasure to.) / مِن فَضْلِك (interjection to make a polite request) / رَجَاءً (interjection to make a polite request) / لَو سَمَحْت (interjection to make a polite request) / لُطْفًا (interjection to make a polite request) / أَرْجُوك (interjection to make a polite request)  [please (do for me)]\nafter te-form of a verb or a noun prefixed with o- or go-",
