 "くだす": "[to make a decision ; to draw a conclusion]\nمثال: 問題は誰が決定を下すかということだ。\n→ The question is who will make the decision. / [to give a judgement ; to hand down a verdict]\nمثال: これらの議論で問題になっている評決は、１９９４年のランダー裁判で下されたものである。\n→ The verdict at issue in these discussions is the one brought in the Lander's trial in 1994. / أَدْنَى, دُنْيَا (Bottom; more towards the bottom than the middle of an object.) / أَنْزَلَ (To let descend by its own weight, as something suspended; to let down.)  [to lower] / [to do oneself ; to do by oneself]\nمثال: 手の下しようが無い。\n→ There's nothing to be done about it.",
