 "くだって": "[humbly]\nused in letters when referring to oneself / فِيمَا بَعْد, بعدين (comparative form of late: more late) / لَاحِقًا (Afterward in time (used with than when comparing with another time).) / فِيمَا بَعْد, فِيمَا بَعْدُ (At some unspecified time in the future.)  [later] / قَادِم (Nearest in place or position, having nothing similar intervening; adjoining.) / تَالٍ (Nearest in order, succession, or rank; immediately following (or sometimes prece) / بِجَانِب (On the side of; nearest or adjacent to; next to.)  [next]\nused when listing items or people by decreasing worth, rank, etc.",
