 "くち": "فَم, بق (The front opening of a creature through which food is ingested.)  [mouth]\nمثال: 椅子に横たわる私に、歯科衛生士の女性が「はい、お口を開けてください」と言ったのです。\n→ The woman dental hygienist said to me, lying down in the chair, \"Right, please open your mouth.\" / مَفْتُوح (Able to be used or interacted with in some way.) / فَتَحَ (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / حل (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / اِنْفَتَحَ (to become open)  [opening]\nمثال: 私たちはそのまま洞窟の口にボートで突っ込んで行きました。\n→ We plunged into the cave opening on our boat and continued on. / فَم, بق (The front opening of a creature through which food is ingested.)  [mouth (of a bottle)]\nمثال: 瓶の口までいっぱいに入れて空気が入らないようにしなさい。\n→ Fill the bottle to the top so as to exclude all air. / بَوَّابَة (A doorlike structure outside a house.)  [gate]",
