 "くちきり": "نَجْمَة, اِبْتِدَاء (The beginning of an activity.) / نَجْمَة (The beginning point of a race, a board game, etc.) / بَدَأَ (To begin, commence, initiate.)  [start] / [event at the start of the tenth month of the lunar calendar] / [opening a sealed jar or container]",
