 "くっだらねー": "تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial]\nمثال: くだらない話はもうたくさんだ。\n→ We have had enough of empty words. / غَبِيّ (Without intelligence.) / غَبِيّ, أَحْمَق (A stupid person; a fool.)  [stupid]",
