 "けす": "مَحَا, مَحَى (To remove (markings or information).) / اِمَّحَى, اِنْمَحَى (To be erased (have markings removed, have information removed, or be cleared of )  [to erase] / [to turn off (a light, TV, heater, etc.) ; to switch off]\nمثال: 寝る前に電気を消してください。\n→ Turn off the light before you go to bed. / أَطْفَأَ (To end (something).)  [to extinguish (a fire, candle, etc.)]\nمثال: 消防士たちはすばやく火事を消した。\n→ The firemen quickly extinguished the blaze. / نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove (a smell, pain, etc.)]\nمثال: どんな言葉も彼女の深い悲しみを消す事はできない。\n→ No words can relieve her deep sorrow.",
