 "こもる": "[to shut oneself in (e.g. one's room) ; to be confined in]\nمثال: 彼は、よく書斎にこもって、こういうものを書きます。\n→ He often shuts himself up in the study and writes things like this. / [to fill with (emotion, enthusiasm, power, etc.) ; to imbue with]\noft. as ...のこもったもの\nمثال: 彼は私に愛情のこもった手紙をくれた。\n→ He sent me an affectionate letter. / [to fill a space (of a gas, smell, etc.) ; to be heavy with (e.g. smoke)] / [to be muffled (e.g. of a voice)]",
 "こもん": "مُسْتَشَار, مُسْتَشَارَة (One who offers advice.)  [advisor]\nمثال: 社長は会議のために顧問たちを集めた。\n→ The president assembled his advisers for a conference. / [school club supervisor (usu. a teacher) ; school club manager]",
